'''Campdària Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de Campdària}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: CDA, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: CDIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Campdària]], a coastal city in [[Migjorn Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport is situated in the [[La Badia]] comarca on the southern coast of the isthmus and serves the surrounding beach resorts and tourism sector. It is a destination for [[Aeroístmus]], which operates services to the airport from [[Sant Cristòfor International Airport|Sant Cristòfor]] and [[Cecilio Ríos International Airport|Sant Bart]], with onward service to [[Marie Torres Airport|Sant Agneu]].

